00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:37,977
But Sergeant Major!

260
00:20:38,060 --> 00:20:39,000
Just do it!

261
00:20:39,120 --> 00:20:41,080
There's only minutes left! Right!

262
00:20:47,900 --> 00:20:50,360
Now, let that man go right away!

263
00:20:50,760 --> 00:20:52,820
I've already warned you to move.

264
00:21:27,120 --> 00:21:28,477
That was bad.

265
00:21:28,560 --> 00:21:31,677
That right hand of his is
gonna be a big problem.

266
00:21:31,760 --> 00:21:35,997
The entire lawn has been
turned into a desert.

267
00:21:36,080 --> 00:21:39,577
Oh great!

268
00:21:39,660 --> 00:21:40,620
Ready go now!

269
00:21:48,680 --> 00:21:51,460
I'm quite tired of
wasting my time with you.

270
00:22:01,460 --> 00:22:02,660
Missed me.

271
00:22:19,420 --> 00:22:23,520
You have lost to me two times now.

272
00:22:24,160 --> 00:22:26,120
Straw Hat, Luffy.
